Design a 4-bit comparator that outputs a signal indicating if two 4-bit inputs, A and B, are equal. The module computes the exclusive OR (XOR) of the two inputs to identify differing bits, and then uses a logical OR operation followed by a NOT operation to determine if all bits are equal. The output signal EQ will be high (1) when A and B are identical, and low (0) when they differ.
