Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build a 5-bit up/down counter with synchronous active high reset signal and direction control signal.
// (1) reset: Resets the counter to 5'b00000.
// (2) dir: Direction control (1 for up, 0 for down).
// (3) q: The value of the counter.

module top_module(
