description:
Design a binary converter that maps a 4-bit binary input to a 2-bit output. The converter outputs values from a specific range, where every four consecutive values in the binary input yield the same 2-bit output. Specifically, inputs from 0 to 3 produce outputs from 00 to 11 in a repeating manner, with inputs outside this range defaulting to output 00. This logic can be viewed as a simplified encoder or decimator for certain input values.
module top_module(
    binary_in,
    binary_out
);

